    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "85 Cherry Garth is an impressive three bedroom semi-detached bungalow boasting a sun room extension to the rear and a private, sunny West facing rear garden. The accommodation extends to 63 sq.m. and comprises entrance hall, living room, kitchen, open to the sun room extension, three bedrooms and bathroom. The property features an upgraded gas boiler and full size windows fitted to bedrooms 2 and 3.  Cherry Garth is a sought after estate located within the popular Rivervalley development with all amenities on your doorstep; bus routes including the Swords Express, schools, shops, church and the picturesque parklands of the Ward Rivervalley Park. Swords Main Street is within walking distance. Easy access is enjoyed to Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways and Airside Retail Park. \r\n\r\n* Sunny West facing rear garden – not overlooked\r\n* Impressive sun room extension\r\n* Modern fitted kitchen complete with integrated appliances\r\n* Gas fired central heating - upgraded gas boiler\r\n* Modern hot water tank and system recently installed (2025)\r\n* Fully tiled bathroom\r\n* Laminate flooring – living room, internal hallway, kitchen and sun room\r\n* Recessed lighting – living room, bathroom, kitchen and sun room\r\n* Ideally located within the established Rivervalley community\r\n* All amenities on your doorstep including bus routes\r\n* Easy walking distance to Swords Main Street\r\n* Well maintained throughout\r\n* Double glazed windows – full size windows fitted to bedrooms 2 & 3\r\n* Adjacent to the Picturesque Ward Rivervalley Park\r\n* Rivervalley enjoys easy access to Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways\r\n* Schools within walking distance:\r\nHoly Family Junior & Senior National Schools\r\nLoreto College Secondary School\r\nColáiste Choilm Secondary School\r\n* Bus Routes:\r\nDublin Bus 41C to Lower Abbey Street\r\nDublin Bus 102 to Sutton Station (Malahide/Portmarnock)\r\nSwords Express – Express service to Dublin City Centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall   -   Tiled floor.\r\n\t\t\t    \r\nLiving room   -   3.4m x 3.6m\r\nFeature fireplace with open fire. Laminate flooring. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nInternal hallway   -   Laminate flooring. Access hatch to attic space.\r\n\r\nKitchen   -   3.7m x 2.5m\r\nModern fully fitted kitchen complete with integrated appliances. Laminate flooring. Recessed lighting. Open to the sun room.\r\n\r\nSun room/Dining area   -   3.4m x 3.1m \r\nImpressive light filled room boasting dual aspect views of the garden. Large roof light floods the room with natural light.  Recessed lighting. Door to rear garden.\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 1   -   2.7m x 3.6m (rear)\r\nDouble room with. Carpet fitted. Built in wardrobe with sliding doors. Built in storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   2.4m x 2.5m\r\nCarpet fitted.\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3   -   2.0m x 2.5m\r\nCarpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   1.8m x 2.2m\r\nModern, fully tiled. Recessed lighting. Heated towel rail. Bath with electric shower fitted. Sink with storage. Toilet.\r\n\t\t\t\r\nOUTSIDE:\t\r\nGarden to the front with lawn, mature trees, concrete driveway and pedestrian side entrance.\r\nThe private rear garden is West facing, not overlooked with lawn, mature planting and timber shed."
      },
